WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
What am I hiding from?

2
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:10,050
Why doesn't he leave yet?

3
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:12,250
Don't catch me pretending to sleep

4
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:16,820
Did I hear Zhuang Yan last night?

5
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:18,620
Why can't I think clearly?

6
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:20,420
Don't drink so much again in the future

7
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:23,870
Forget it. I don’t want to think about it. Let’s eat first.

8
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:26,890
Shenwan, I was so sorry yesterday

9
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:28,290
I drank too much and caused you trouble.

10
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:29,690
Why are you so rude to me?

11
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:32,690
It's okay. It's rare to relax for once. You just woke up, right?

12
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:34,090
Drink some hot sister wine

13
00:00:34,490 --> 00:00:36,290
God, I woke up last night

14
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:40,490
Wake up. I slept well last night. You asked me for something. What I said last night was that you didn’t hear me.

15
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:41,490
What happened? I forgot

16
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:42,690
S City Rescue Base Open Education Center

17
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:43,690
You can use materials to exchange for machine points

18
00:00:43,690 --> 00:00:46,090
Internal officers can also exchange machine points for weapons. I think you need weapons.

19
00:00:46,490 --> 00:00:47,690
What supplies does the base need?

20
00:00:47,690 --> 00:00:49,690
I brought back a redemption manual. You can read it.

21
00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:50,890
I'm going down to find you now

22
00:00:50,890 --> 00:00:51,890
OK, come on
